cal causation.", "historicalSignificance": {"significanceScore": 7, "significanceNarrative": "The IEEE has profoundly influenced the development of modern technology and engineering practices, establishing thousands of standards that shape industries and enhance global communication. Its role as a professional body has fostered collaboration among engineers, resulting in innovations that drive the digital age.", "significanceCategory": "regional"}, "_editLog": [{"timestamp": "2026-06-15T14:47:19Z", "editorId": "gpt-4o-mini·cloud·GH#27554080743", "field": "summary", "oldValue": "American professional association for electronic engineering and electrical engineering Headquartered in Manhattan. Founded 1963.", "newValue": "The Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers (IEEE), founded in 1963, stands as a cornerstone of technological advancement, particularly in the fields of electrical and electronic engineering. Headquartered in Manhattan, New York, the organization emerged from the merger of the American Institute of Electrical Engineers and the Institute of Radio Engineers, uniting thousands of professionals who would shape innovations that define the modern world. It has played a pivotal role in developing standards that govern everything from telecommunications to computer networking, thereby influencing countless industries and enhancing the quality of life globally.

